{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20776","headline":"常州孟谏议座上闻韩员外职方贬国子博士有感五首 四 · 卢仝","name":"常州孟谏议座上闻韩员外职方贬国子博士有感五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"力小垂垂上，天高又不登。\n致身唯一己，获罪则颜朋。\n禄位埋坑穽，康庄垒劒棱。\n公卿共惜取，莫遣玉山崩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}